{"id": null, "n": "0262012", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0262012", "type": "mod", "text": "法【大】，得法【宋】【元】【明】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0262013", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0262013", "type": "mod", "text": "〔－〕【CB】【磧-CB】【宋】【元】【明】【宮】，與【大】"}
